     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Michael, <div><br></div><div>To do it quickly you might break the data.frame into two and reshape them separately.</div><div><br></div><div>For a better solution, it would be easier for me (probably others too) if you provided your data (just a sample) in a format easily inputtable into R. You could do the following, assuming you already have your data in a data.frame in R that is named dat:</div><div><br></div><div>dput(head(dat))</div><div><br></div><div>and then paste the results into the email.</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
