    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Tuesday, July 26, 2016 at 1:51:21 PM UTC-7, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mjculsh...@ucdavis.edu</a> wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi everyone,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve currently got an output from NetLogo in a CSV file, but the formatting of the data is a bit strange. I need some help getting it into a usable format in R, but I can&#39;t quite figure out how to get it there. I&#39;ve gotten partway using tidyr::gather, but I need a bit more help.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s the output I get: </div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"562\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:562pt\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"107\" style=\"width:107pt\">\r\n <col width=\"65\" span=\"7\" style=\"width:65pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" width=\"107\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:107pt\">Run</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">2</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">2</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">3</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">3</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">4</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">MovementOdds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"