td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">68</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">63</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">65</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">65</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">68</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">63</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">65</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">64</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">68</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">63</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">65</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">64</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n\r\n</tbody></table><br></div><div>Each of the numerical values below represent a count of individuals, and each step down a column represents a time step.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I would like to have the data formatted like this, in the end:</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"364\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:364pt\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"2\" style=\"width:65pt\">\r\n <col width=\"104\" style=\"width:104pt\">\r\n <col width=\"65\" span=\"2\" style=\"width:65pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" width=\"65\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:65pt\">Time</td>\r\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">Run</td>\r\n  <td width=\"104\" style=\"width:104pt\">MovementOdds</td>\r\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">Infection</td>\r\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">Count</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20 </td>\r\n  <td>uninfecteds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">70</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">2</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20 </td>\r\n  <td>uninfecteds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">70</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">3</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20 </td>\r\n  <td>uninfecteds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">70</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">4</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20 </td>\r\n  <td>uninfecteds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">69</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">5</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20 </td>\r\n  <td>uninfecteds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">69</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">6</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20 </td>\r\n  <td>uninfecteds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">68</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">7</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20 </td>\r\n  <td>uninfecteds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">68</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">8</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20 </td>\r\n  <td>uninfecteds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">68</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">9</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20 </td>\r\n  <td>uninfecteds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">68</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">10</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">20 </td>\r\n  <td>uninfecteds</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">67</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n\r\n</tbody></table><br><br>Where Run is used to organize the data.<br><br></div><div><br></div><div>I can get the data tidy based on Run if I don&#39;t include infection status or movement odds, but I just can&#39;t figure out how to get it to work when those two variables are included as rows. I&#39;m not sure if this will involve pure R trickery or if some of the reshaping should be done in Excel prior to reading it to R.</div><div><br></div><div>Any help would be appreciated- if someone needs an actual Excel file to goof around with rather than the abbreviated table I provided, just let me know.</div><div><br></div><div>Many thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Michael Culshaw-Maurer</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
